[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0010","text":"凛世，调温我来换你\n这边交给你了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0020","text":"谢谢您……\n待会儿……我们换班吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0030","text":"好，拜托了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0040","text":"智代子，我们也换一下吧\n打发很累吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0050","text":"谢谢！那我就不客气稍微恢复一下……！\n待会儿再换回来哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0060","text":"嗯！\n就指望你了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0070","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0080","text":"怎么了……\n发生什么事了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0090","text":"果穗？\n出什么事了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900200_04_0100","text":"没有！\n我只是觉得放学后CLIMAX GIRLS真是个了不起的组合！"}]
